 main tree-lined shore, there's a steep, grassy embankment leading up toward higher ground. This area has patches of green vegetation mixed in with brown soil, showing less intense coloration than the foreground forest but still contributing texture and depth to the composition.\n\nThe overall lighting suggests it might be late afternoon sun casting long shadows across the terrain, enhancing the three-dimensionality and richness of colors throughout the frame. The perspective gives viewers a sense of scale while immersing them directly within this tranquil yet dynamic autumnal setting.\n  \nIn summary: **An aerial shot showcasing a curving road beside a river flowing between two slopes covered in brilliant orange-and-gold fall leaves; minimal traffic adds life without disruption.**"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 12, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "easy showAnything", "title": "Show Any（显示上个节点输出内容）", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.4", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [354.9341735839844, 340.0969543457031], "pos": [620, 750], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 13, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "source"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "PreviewAny", "title": "Preview as Text（同左边（可有可无，个人喜好））", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.77", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [11, 12], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#28403f", "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "None (FP16)", "Describe this image in detail.", "🖼️ Detailed Description", 512, 512, 1, 1553969602], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 1, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "na